<BaseLayout title="Site & Services Disclaimer | Tender of the Soul"
  ><PageHero
    eyebrow="Important information"
    title="Site and services disclaimer"
    intro="Clear boundaries help create an honest foundation for this work."
  /><section class="section">
    <div class="narrow prose">
      <h2>Nature of services</h2><p>
        Elana is a Hakomi and body-centered practitioner and is not currently a
        licensed therapist, psychologist, psychotherapist, counselor, clinical
        social worker, or mental-health provider. Services offered by Tender of
        the Soul are non-licensed, educational, experiential, and supportive in
        nature.
      </p><h2>Not medical or crisis care</h2><p>
        Services and website content are not a substitute for medical care,
        psychiatric care, psychotherapy, crisis support, diagnosis, or treatment
        from an appropriately licensed professional. Tender of the Soul does not
        provide emergency or crisis services.
      </p><h2>No guarantees</h2><p>
        Descriptions on this site reflect possibilities and intentions, not
        guarantees. Individual experiences vary, and no specific therapeutic,
        medical, emotional, or spiritual outcome is promised.
      </p><h2>Educational content</h2><p>
        Journal articles and other site materials are for general educational
        purposes and should not be treated as individualized advice.
      </p><h2>Required review</h2><p>
        This draft must be reviewed by a qualified Hawaiʻi professional familiar
        with local scope-of-practice, consumer protection, privacy, and business
        requirements before publication.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section></BaseLayout
>
